        "tab_1": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does it help with?",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Raw Coffee+ gives you calm, steady energy without jitters or the afternoon crash. Lion's Mane, Bacopa and Ginkgo support focus and memory, Holy Basil helps you handle stress, and 3,000 mg of creatine supports your body's natural energy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_2": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to use",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Add one scoop (7 g) to 8–12 oz of hot water or milk and stir for 15 seconds. Prefer it iced? Dissolve it in a splash of hot water, then add ice and oat milk. One cup a day, best in the morning.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How are results for people with sensitive stomachs?",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Our low-acid, low-caffeine Arabica is much gentler than regular coffee. L-Theanine slows caffeine absorption, so most customers with sensitive stomachs report no acid reflux, bloating or jitters.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_4": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does it taste like?",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Bold Arabica flavor with a deep, full-bodied mushroom note from our 10:1 Lion’s Mane extract, the highest amount among functional coffees on the market. No artificial flavors or maskers, just the real taste of a quality mushroom coffee that works.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_5": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Low-caffeine 100% Arabica blended with Lion's Mane 10:1 extract, creatine, L-Theanine, Taurine, L-Tyrosine, Bacopa, Ginkgo and Holy Basil. 30 servings per bag. Vegan, non-GMO, no added sugar, made in the USA and third-party lab tested.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
